msgstr "Prospectus de la conferencia global de PyLadies."

#: src/pages/[lang]/sponsors.astro:205
msgid ""
"Support PyLadies as we work to improve diversity by bringing fresh talent "
"into the Python community and to support both seasoned and budding "
"developers through workshops, community activities, and local advocacy."
msgstr ""
"Apoya a PyLadies mientras trabajamos para mejorar la diversidad incorporando "
"nuevos talentos a la comunidad Python y apoyando tanto a personas "
"desarrolladoras experimentadas como a principiantes a través de talleres, "
"actividades comunitarias y defensa local."

#: src/pages/[lang]/sponsors.astro:206
msgid ""
"Your support will help PyLadies provide financial support to help more women "
"around the world with training, mentorship, and aid to attend conferences "
"and community events."
msgstr ""
"Tu apoyo ayudará a PyLadies a brindar apoyo financiero para ayudar a más "
"mujeres de todo el mundo con capacitación, tutoría y ayuda para asistir a "
"conferencias y eventos comunitarios."

#: src/pages/[lang]/sponsors.astro:207
msgid ""
"To learn more and to join us as a sponsor, please contact us, and a member "
"of our sponsorship team will get back to you soon. Please get in touch by "
"writing to <a href=\"mailto:sponsors@pyladies.com\">sponsors@pyladies.com</a>"
msgstr ""
"Para obtener más información y unirse como patrocinador, contáctenos y una "
"persona de nuestro equipo de patrocinio se pondrá en contacto con usted en "
"breve. Para contactarnos, escriba a <a "
"href=\"mailto:sponsors@pyladies.com\">sponsors@pyladies.com</a>"

